WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Stand a straw in a glass of
water and look from the side.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.130
At the surface, the
straw seems to snap.

3
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.950
Pull it out, and it's
perfectly straight.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.010
Nothing happened to the straw.

5
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:15.070
So what is the light doing
on its way to your eye?

6
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.350
In this mission, you'll
learn the law of reflection,

7
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.240
measuring every angle from
a line called the normal.

8
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.470
You'll see what happens to
light's speed when it crosses from

9
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.930
one material into another,

10
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.670
and work out when a ray bends
towards the normal and when it

11
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.050
bends away.

12
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.460
Your mission: find out why a
straight straw looks snapped.
